          "docs": "Create an indicator entity\nTo update indicator custom fields you should lowercase them and remove all spaces. For example: Scan IP -> scanip"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Edit Indicator",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
